        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Manoel de Oliveira, Alfonso Cuarón\n- Films: The Hunt, A Little Princess\n- Places: Cedofeita, Porto, Portugal, Mexico\n- Roles: film directors, screenwriters, producer, editor\n\nFacts:\n- Manoel de Oliveira was born on 11 December 1908 in Cedofeita, Porto, and he was a Portuguese film director and screenwriter.\n- The Hunt is a 1963 short Portuguese film directed by Manoel de Oliveira.\n- Alfonso Cuarón was born on November 28, 1961, and he is a Mexican film director, screenwriter, producer, and editor.\n- Alfonso Cuarón is best known for the drama A Little Princess, released in 1995.\n- Manoel de Oliveira died on 2 April 2015.",
